      "text": "the revelations to, D&C 32; 49. is called to declare gospel with Oliver Cowdery and Peter Whitmer, D&C 32:2. is called to preach gospel to Shakers, D&C 49:1. to strengthen churches by exhortation, D&C 50:37. to journey to Missouri, preaching along way, D&C 52:26. presides over School of Prophets, D&C 97:3–5. revelation given after arrival of Parley P. Pratt in Kirtland, D&C 103. to gather company to go up to Zion, D&C 103:30. member of Twelve, D&C 124:129.",
